    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone <div><br></div><div>I am interested in creating a distance matrix with morphological distances among each and all  individuals in a dataset. At the moment I´m at a loss as how to do this. </div><div><br></div><div>Bjarni</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
